   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Coins We Use 🪙",
   "text": "Small shiny circles! ₹1, ₹2, ₹5, ₹10. Each coin has its value written on it.",
   "emoji": "🪙",
   "bgColor": "from-orange-400 to-amber-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Notes We Use 💵",
   "text": "Colourful paper money! ₹10, ₹20, ₹50, ₹100... The bigger the number, the more you can buy!",
   "emoji": "💵",
   "bgColor": "from-green-400 to-emerald-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Adding Money ➕",
   "text": "₹5 coin + ₹2 coin = ₹7! We add coin values just like numbers. Try it with toys first!",
   "emoji": "➕",
   "bgColor": "from-blue-400 to-indigo-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Shopping Time! 🛒",
